# Teaching Sustainability Analysis in Electrical Engineering Lab Courses

**Authors:** Braun, D.

## Abstract
Laboratory courses represent an incompletely tapped opportunity to teach sustainability concepts. This work introduces and evaluates a simple strategy used to teach sustainability concepts in electrical engineering laboratory courses. The technique would readily adapt to other disciplines. The paper presents assessment data and a wiki containing student sustainability analyses. (Contains 4 figures.)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ900577

